d 'ODKREPEATMERGE': module to merge ODK repeat-group data into one wide dataset in questionnaire order
d
d  odkrepeatmerge combines the main CSV file and the repeat-group
d CSV files exported from ODK Central into one wide Stata dataset
d with one row per submission. It reads the XLSForm to find the
d repeat groups and how they are nested (to any depth), reshapes
d each repeat group to wide form, merges it into its parent, labels
d the variables from the XLSForm, and orders them as in the
d questionnaire. Instance numbers are taken from ODK's KEY, group
d prefixes in column names are removed, and the command stops with
d a clear message rather than losing or misplacing data when
d variable names would clash. 
d
d KW: ODK
d KW: ODK Central
d KW: XLSForm
d KW: repeat groups
d KW: reshape
d KW: survey data
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261125
d
d Author: Arman Mahmud ,  ARCED Foundation
d Support: email arman.mahmud.stat@@gmail.com
d
f odkrepeatmerge.ado
f odkrepeatmerge.sthlp
